# Tauri Command Implementation

## Security Rules Applied
- **§2 Desktop Process Isolation**: Named commands only, no generic invoke, path canonicalization and confinement required
- **§4 Deep Links**: Frontend input treated as untrusted, path validation before filesystem access
- **§1 Storage**: No sensitive data persistence involved

